-- `render_colors`: $[C, H, W, 3]$ rendered RGB images [S1, unofficial].
-- `render_alphas`: $[C, H, W, 1]$ rendered alpha channels [S1, unofficial].
-- `render_normals`: $[C, H, W, 3]$ rendered normal vectors [S1, unofficial].
+**Inputs and Outputs:**
