+    *   `opacities`: Per-surfel opacity, shape `[N]`.
+    *   `colors`: Per-surfel color coefficients or SH coefficients. If SH is used, shape `[N, K, 3]` where $K$ is the number of SH bands; otherwise `[N, 3]` or `[C, N, 3]`.
